    <briefdescription>
<para>Test suite for the shell history module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>pulgamecanica (arosado-)</para>
</simplesect>
Tests history_file_path() POSIX lookup order ($HISTFILE → $HOME/.sh_history) and the history_save() / history_load() file round-trip via readline&apos;s in-memory history list (history_list(), history_length, clear_history()).</para>
<para>Guarded by <computeroutput>TEST_HISTORY_ENABLED</computeroutput> (set in <computeroutput>TEST_FLAGS</computeroutput> in the root Makefile). Once all assertions pass permanently, remove the #ifdef guards and the <computeroutput>-D</computeroutput> flag from the Makefile. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
